  "title": "Jade Biosciences Announces Inducement Grant Under Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(c)(4)",
  "summary": "SAN FRANCISCO and VANCOUVER, British Columbia, April 23, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Jade Biosciences, Inc. (“Jade” or the “Company”) (Nasdaq: JBIO), a clinical-stage biotechnology company focused on developing best-in-class therapies for autoimmune diseases, today announced that Jade’s Board of Directors granted an equity award to Edward R. Conner, M.D., effective as of April 22, 2026, … Continued",
